{"parentUuid":"0e579740-c018-4c6f-978e-882cd63e76a6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGaqMD1KqeTyX6nG1iDz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013GCxUZr8BhBSqTKrBELXf1","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git add fun/hedgerow/js/effects.js fun/hedgerow/README.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: bullet hits burst out of the surface\n\nIn a live firefight and in controlled hits on stone, wood, steel and\nmud, every hit left two round, pale dust balls hanging in the dark with\nno direction to them. AAA hits burst out of the surface.\n\nNow two or three jets of the surface's dust and grit shoot out of the\nhole in a cone round its face. They are thrown on along the way the\nround glanced off (the bullet's direction reflected in the face), drawn\nas streaks along their speed, and stopped short by the air within a\nthird of a second, rounding off as they slow. One ragged cloud is left\nhanging, smaller and darker than before, and drifts off. Stone,\nconcrete and steel also flash white-hot for a frame or two at the\nstrike. Flesh hits are unchanged.\n\nA/B'd on five surfaces at 2 and 12 frames after the hit, and in a 60 fps\nburst raking a wall (the page clock stepped 1/60 s a frame). One or two\nmore particles per hit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -2","description":"Commit the reworked bullet impacts"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":715,"cache_read_input_tokens":697110,"output_tokens":873,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":715,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":873,"cache_rea