{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","hash":"74d5c6f3a6a6e07861744455745ac1aa6fb62bc0c8e8b422488b8756ae0c9252","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Committed c0e6a461. Sending the burst clip, then notes and teardown:"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01ANDAdhM7v2xprCSVMNtytp","name":"SendUserFile","input":{"files":["REDACTED.mp4"],"caption":"1.6 s at an exact 60 fps, headless: an MG burst raking a stone wall with the new hits (commit c0e6a461).","status":"normal","display":"attach"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CfBAzMjfgFuv9bxsfoEZaK","name":"mcp__ccd_turn__update_plan","input":{"done":[1,2,3,4],"start":5},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NEZ3pjXguk2WQNViNMy2jZ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"N=\"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md\"; cat >> \"$N\" <<'EOF'\n\nTurn of 2026-10-22, twelfth:\n- Live firefight capture (fight.js: god-mode player at (1.5, 266) facing the bridge nest, AI left\n  running, a snap every ~90 ms): enemy muzzle flashes at ~20 m are ~10 px for 2-3 frames (life\n  0.04-0.05 s) - easy to miss; the lamplight rain around each flash shows more than the flash.\n  Candidate for later: a minimum on-screen size for distant muzzle flashes (aMisc.w is free for\n  additive particles: P.dense is only read by lit ones) - not done.\n- Controlled hits (impacts.js: camera ~5 m off a surface, effects.impact + decals.impact x3, frames\n  2 and 12 after): the old two round pale dust balls had no direction. NB the pak40 reports\n  surface 'stone', the bunker view hit inside the slit.\n- c0e6a461 hits burst out of the surface (effects.impact, non-flesh): 2-3 jets (smoke cell,\n  streak 0.05, speed 3-7, drag 7, life 0.24-0.38, along n + 0.3-0.7 x the reflected round), one\n  smaller darker puff (0.1 -> 0.45-0.65, a 0.42, fadeIn 0.06), and for spark surfaces a 0.035 s\n  flash sprite. Flesh unchanged.\n- 60 fps capture of anything driven by the frame time: override performance.now in the page and\n  step it 1000/60 ms per captured frame (burst.js) - the game's timer then gives exact dt.\n  Checks: low/medium/high compile (0 bad), 9 node checks, merge-tree clean. Clip mv_burst.mp4 sent.\n  Not seen in a real browser window.\nEOF\nREDACTED; cd $S && node hl.mjs stop; rm -rf hl-profile; pkill -f \"nocache_server.py 8766\"; sleep 1; lsof -nP -iTCP:8766 -sTCP:LISTEN | head -2; lsof -nP -iTCP:9337 -sTCP:LISTEN | head -2; pgrep -fl \"hl-profile|nocache_server\" | head; cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git status --short | head; git log --oneline -1","description":"Note this turn, stop the rig and verify it is down","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true,"timeout":60000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
