{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","hash":"02da49ff0380a7b8a98c44caed25a7d82454836fbc951ee9db3f34f64677671b","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Next round: the item I left open last time, distant enemy muzzle flashes that are easy to miss. I'll give additive particles an optional minimum on-screen size. Muzzle-flash stars and flame tongues (and, faintly, bullet strikes) then stay a readable few pixels at any range, dimmed as they grow so they don't turn into blobs, while embers and sparks keep their real size."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016gW38iXs8VAkrn2wYAWnUo","name":"mcp__ccd_turn__update_plan","input":{"items":[{"content":"Add a minimum on-screen size for flashes","status":"in_progress"},{"content":"A/B flashes at 20, 40 and 80 m","status":"pending"},{"content":"Check them in a live firefight","status":"pending"},{"content":"Commit, clip and notes","status":"pending"},{"content":"Tear down the test rig","status":"pending"}],"scope":"continuation"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VsBZAYpGfvmzTGQAX2Lwjw","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 -I REDACTED.py 8766 /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","description":"Serve the worktree on port 8766 for headless checks","run_in_background":true,"dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013pHqmskYZ93rKt4Nr2z3u1","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow/js && sed -n 318,330p effects.js; grep -n \"uScreen\" effects.js | head -8","description":"Read the particle spawn fields and screen-size uniform"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
