{"parentUuid":"8e5b2667-5729-40a7-bba2-cd724bbf4040","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGbXQWpLbaZmuFR4y1yb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PTVR49c4QqrQczSszAudQh","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"N=\"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md\"; cat >> \"$N\" <<'EOF'\n\nTurn of 2026-10-22, thirteenth:\n- 13e7a518 distant muzzle flashes stay visible: effects.js spawn option `minPx` (stored in\n  P.dense -> aMisc.w; only additive particles read it, lit ones read it as `dense`), VERT sprite\n  branch grows the quad to minPx pixels (px from view depth, as the streak code) and dims by\n  grow^-0.35; muzzle star 14, flame tongues 9, strike flash 3. flash1.js measures a single flash\n  with the rain off and a stepped clock (diff of the frame before/after).\n  weather.js: flashes lit the rain like lamps (2-4.5 m ball, full strength, every shot) and that\n  ball was what showed of a distant MG - now flash slots: box 1.6 m, uLampFade 0.35 (alpha and\n  the brightness cap), drops' vertex light from flashes x0.3 (setLights, l.flash).\n  Live fight check (fight.js at z 255, a flare was up): the MG at the bridge's far end now a\n  distinct star. Clip mv_mg.mp4 (stepped clock, bursts of 8, tracer every 4th) sent.\n  Checks: low/medium/high compile (97/147/147, 0 bad), 9 node checks, merge-tree clean.\n  Not seen in a real browser window.\nEOF\nREDACTED; cd $S && node hl.mjs stop; rm -rf hl-profile; pkill -f \"nocache_server.py 8766\"; sleep 1; lsof -nP -iTCP:8766 -sTCP:LISTEN | head -2; lsof -nP -iTCP:9337 -sTCP:LISTEN | head -2; pgrep -fl \"hl-profile|nocache_server\" | head; cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git status --short | head; git log --oneline -1","description":"Note this turn, stop the rig and verify it is down","timeout":60000,"dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_s