l-profile|nocache_server\" | head; cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git status --short | head; git log --oneline -1","description":"Note this turn, stop the rig and verify it is down","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true,"timeout":60000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
