{"parentUuid":"791e63ed-8fb0-4ad1-a614-040a9c34dd1f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGbmXnkQXjJ9bgtuE3Pz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VttmVfxzYB42aMKDQF6yGD","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"REDACTED; cd $S && cat > dv_cfg.js <<'EOF'\nwindow.__dv = [\n  [-1.0, 300.0, -8.0, 0.5, 330.0, 'fN', []],\n  [-1.0, 300.0, 28.0, 0.5, 300.0, 'fE', []],\n  [-1.0, 300.0, 4.0, 0.5, 270.0, 'fS', []],\n];\nwindow.__dvar = [['base', {}], ['nosun', { noSun: true }]];\nreturn 1;\nEOF\nnode hl.mjs eval dv_cfg.js >/dev/null; node hl.mjs eval flare_diag.js | python3 -c \"import json,sys; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print(d['sunI'], d['flare'])\"\ncd snaps && python3 -I -c \"\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageStat\nfor v in ['fN','fE','fS']:\n    for t in ['base','nosun']:\n        im=Image.open(f'fd_{v}_{t}.jpg').convert('RGB')\n        lo=im.crop((0,int(im.height*0.6),im.width,im.height))\n        st=ImageStat.Stat(lo); m=[round(x) for x in st.mean]\n        # brightest 5% of the lower part: their mean colour\n        px=sorted(lo.getdata(), key=lambda p: sum(p))[-len(lo.getdata())//20:]\n        top=[round(sum(p[i] for p in px)/len(px)) for i in range(3)]\n        print(v,t,'lower-third mean',m,'top5%',top)\nims=[Image.open(f'fd_{v}_{t}.jpg').resize((400,300)) for t in ['base','nosun'] for v in ['fN','fE','fS']]\ng=Image.new('RGB',(400*3+8,300*2+4),(255,0,0))\nfor i,c in enumerate(ims): g.paste(c,((i%3)*404,(i//3)*304))\ng.save('fdg_dirs.jpg',quality=90)\n\"","description":"Compare the flare-lit floor facing the flare, sideways and away","timeout":400000,"dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2853,"cache_read_input_tokens":548719,"output_tokens":1239,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":333},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web