es the","-    same light from the bolt's direction),","+    same light from the bolt's direction), `canopy.js` (the trees' shade","+    from that light where its shadow map does not reach: at load the","+    planted trees' crowns are laid on a 1 m map from above, how much sky","+    each metre of ground has over it in leaves - a pine or a fir thick, an","+    oak or a beech a little less, a birch thin, a dead tree hardly - and","+    the ground dims the flare's light by it, looked up where the light's","+    ray passes through the crowns ten metres up (in the vertex shader: the","+    ground's fragment shader has no texture unit to spare), from where the","+    shadow map ends and, on low quality, which draws no shadows for the","+    flare, everywhere, so the forest floor under a flare no longer glazes","+    pale as if it lay in the open),","     `effects.js` (particles: smoke and dust lit by the nearest lamps,","     fires and flashes, soft where they meet the scene; a muzzle flash a","     white-hot star in ragged orange tongues of burning gas, never the same"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"5bf08005-9437-49e8-bd62-f5ed174d7e86","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","root":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","branch":"hedgerow-grass","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":2,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","platform":