{"parentUuid":"0849e984-e5e5-4c32-a5ac-04ca758a3f7d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGw8cFSjbbvZC4MrUh8d","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Kzp11XVTWAiZRFR35nSunw","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"N=\"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md\"; cat >> \"$N\" <<'EOF'\n\nTurn of 2026-10-22, fifteenth (user: \"rebase before\", then the far forest floor fix):\n- Rebased hedgerow-grass onto main 4dab1486 (hedgerow-poc is gone: merged into main and deleted).\n  42 commits replayed linearly, no conflicts; the rebased tree == old tip + main's new commit\n  (head bob, camera.js/player.js/fp-check only). git fetch failed (the sandbox has no SSH key), so\n  main = origin/main as last fetched. origin/hedgerow-grass still at the pre-rebase 9a3721b4: a\n  push would need --force-with-lease (not done: I never push).\n- ac5ee8d4 canopy.js: top-down crown cover map (1 m, bounds -100..100 x -45..610, built at load from\n  veg.kinds: pine/fir 0.85, oak/beech 0.8, birch 0.55, tree_dead 0.25, smoothstep edge over the\n  outer 40% of r = 0.9 x half the model box spread x scale, 2 box-blur passes of 2 m); terrain only\n  (addCanopy(shader, 'vWPos')). Patch of three's lights_fragment_begin directional loop (anchor:\n  `vDirectionalShadowCoord[ i ] ) : 1.0;` + `#endif`): canopyFar(dirView, coord) - flare light\n  picked by world direction vs CANOPY_UNIFORMS.uFlareDir (setCanopyLight(G.flares.light) in main\n  after lightning), mix(1 - 0.9 cover, 1, inMap) with inMap = smoothstep(.02, .12, edge dist) of\n  the shadow coord; #else branch (no shadow map, i.e. low) = canopy everywhere.\n  GOTCHA: the terrain fragment shader is at MAX_TEXTURE_IMAGE_UNITS 16 - a new sampler fails to\n  link (\"texture image units count exceeds\"); hence the vertex-shader lookup (vCanopy).\n  The ortho shadow box is +-40 m in light space: along the beam it reaches 40/sin(elev) (~62 m at\n  40 deg), across it 40 m. On high the visible far floor is mostly inside it - effect on long\n  sightlines only; on low (no flare shadows) big: lower-half mean 22 -> 12, 20 -> 10.5.\n  Checks: low/medium/high compile (97/147/147, 0 bad), 9 node checks, merge-tree with main clean.\n  Not seen in a real browser window.\nEOF\nREDACTED; cd $S && node hl.mjs stop; rm -rf hl-profile; pkill -f \"nocache_server.py 8766\"; sleep 1; lsof -nP -iTCP:8766 -sTCP:LISTEN | head -2; lsof -nP -iTCP:9337 -sTCP:LISTEN | head -2; pgrep -fl \"hl-profile|nocache_server\" | head; cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git status --short | head; git log --oneline -1","description":"Note this turn, stop the rig and verify it is down","timeout":60000,"dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1571,"cache_read_input_tokens":711619,"output_tokens":1732,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1571,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1732,"cache_read_input_tokens":711619,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1571,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1571},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01Kzp11XVTWAiZRFR35nSunw":{"command":"N=\"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md\"; cat >> \"$N\" <<'EOF'\n\nTurn of 2026-10-22, fifteenth (user: \"rebase before\", then the far forest floor fix):\n- Rebased hedgerow-grass onto main 4dab1486 (hedgerow-poc is gone: merged into main and deleted).\n  42 commits replayed linearly, no conflicts; the rebased tree == old tip + main's new commit\n  (head bob, camera.js/player.js/fp-check only). git fetch failed (the sandbox has no SSH key), so\n  main = origin/main as last fetched. origin/hedgerow-grass still at the pre-rebase 9a3721b4: a\n  push would need --force-with-lease (not done: I never push).\n- ac5ee8d4 canopy.js: top-down crown cover map (1 m, bounds -100..100 x -45..610, built at load from\n  veg.kinds: pine/fir 0.85, oak/beech 0.8, birch 0.55, tree_dead 0.25, smoothstep edge over the\n  outer 40% of r = 0.9 x half the model box spread x scale, 2 box-blur passes of 2 m); terrain only\n  (addCanopy(shader, 'vWPos')). Patch of three's lights_fragment_begin directional loop (anchor:\n  `vDirectionalShadowCoord[ i ] ) : 1.0;` + `#endif`): canopyFar(dirView, coord) - flare light\n  picked by world direction vs CANOPY_UNIFORMS.uFlareDir (setCanopyLight(G.flares.light) in main\n  after lightning), mix(1 - 0.9 cover, 1, inMap) with inMap = smoothstep(.02, .12, edge dist) of\n  the shadow coord; #else branch (no shadow map, i.e. low) = canopy everywhere.\n  GOTCHA: the terrain fragment shader is at MAX_TEXTURE_IMAGE_UNITS 16 - a new sampler fails to\n  link (\"texture image units count exceeds\"); hence the vertex-shader lookup (vCanopy).\n  The ortho shadow box is +-40 m in light space: along the beam it reaches 40/sin(elev) (~62 m at\n  40 deg), across it 40 m. On high the visible far floor is mostly inside it - effect on long\n  sightlines only; on low (no flare shadows) big: lower-half mean 22 -> 12, 20 -> 10.5.\n  Checks: low/medium/high compile (97/147/147, 0 bad), 9 node checks, merge-tree with main clean.\n  Not seen in a real browser window.\nEOF\nREDACTED; cd $S && node hl.mjs stop; rm -rf hl-profile; pkill -f \"nocache_server.py 8766\"; sleep 1; lsof -nP -iTCP:8766 -sTCP:LISTEN | head -2; lsof -nP -iTCP:9337 -sTCP:LISTEN | head -2; pgrep -fl \"hl-profile|nocache_server\" | head; cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git status --short | head; git log -