{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","hash":"38428c5a2eb049d3bd28686d0e8c50210f78ec84c9b2fc697ad0c22b2fd1ca66","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Committed ac5ee8d4. Sending the low-quality before/after, then notes and teardown."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TpP2Nx4XB8xuja7G3KkM5r","name":"SendUserFile","input":{"files":["REDACTED.jpg"],"caption":"Low quality, the forest track under a flare, headless: before (left, the floor glazed pale) vs canopy shading (right, commit ac5ee8d4).","status":"normal","display":"render"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017GAcAtBFa7mrLAHnj9kgZW","name":"mcp__ccd_turn__update_plan","input":{"done":[1,2,3,4],"start":5},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Kzp11XVTWAiZRFR35nSunw","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"N=\"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md\"; cat >> \"$N\" <<'EOF'\n\nTurn of 2026-10-22, fifteenth (user: \"rebase before\", then the far forest floor fix):\n- Rebased hedgerow-grass onto main 4dab1486 (hedgerow-poc is gone: merged into main and deleted).\n  42 commits replayed linearly, no conflicts; the rebased tree == old tip + main's new commit\n  (head bob, camera.js/player.js/fp-check only). git fetch failed (the sandbox has no SSH key), so\n  main = origin/main as last fetched. origin/hedgerow-grass still at the pre-rebase 9a3721b4: a\n  push would need --force-with-lease (not done: I never push).\n- ac5ee8d4 canopy.js: top-down crown cover map (1 m, bounds -100..100 x -45..610, built at load from\n  veg.kinds: pine/fir 0.85, oak/beech 0.8, birch 0.55, tree_dead 0.25, smoothstep edge over the\n  outer 40% of r = 0.9 x half the model box spread x scale, 2 box-blur passes of 2 m); terrain only\n  (addCanopy(shader, 'vWPos')). Patch of three's lights_fragment_begin directional loop (anchor:\n  `vDirectionalShadowCoord[ i ] ) : 1.0;` + `#endif`): canopyFar(dirView, coord) - flare light\n  picked by world direction vs CANOPY_UNIFORMS.uFlareDir (setCanopyLight(G.flares.light) in main\n  after lightning), mix(1 - 0.9 cover, 1, inMap) with inMap = smoothstep(.02, .12, edge dist) of\n  the shadow coord; #else branch (no shadow map, i.e. low) = canopy everywhere.\n  GOTCHA: the terrain fragment shader is at MAX_TEXTURE_IMAGE_UNITS 16 - a new sampler fails to\n  link (\"texture image units count exceeds\"); hence the vertex-shader lookup (vCanopy).\n  The ortho shadow box is +-40 m in light space: along the beam it reaches 40/sin(elev) (~62 m at\n  40 deg), across it 40 m. On high the visible far floor is mostly inside it - effect on long\n  sightlines only; on low (no flare shadows) big: lower-half mean 22 -> 12, 20 -> 10.5.\n  Checks: low/medium/high compile (97/147/147, 0 bad), 9 node checks, merge-tree with main clean.\n  Not seen in a real browser window.\nEOF\nREDACTED; cd $S && node hl.mjs stop; rm -rf hl-profile; pkill -f \"nocache_server.py 8766\"; sleep 1; lsof -nP -iTCP:8766 -sTCP:LISTEN | head -2; lsof -nP -iTCP:9337 -sTCP:LISTEN | head -2; pgrep -fl \"hl-profile|nocache_server\" | head; cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git status --short | head; git log --oneline -1","description":"Note this turn, stop the rig and verify it is down","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true,"timeout":60000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
