{"parentUuid":"916108cc-9df1-47b1-889d-c81134ea2b38","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"271b7250-8fae-4799-957d-05a5211730a7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RPVxhQcDegV9SGj5kiwSh1","type":"tool_result","content":"    water throws up a spout of spray and spreads a ring flat on it; a round\n    into a hedge or a bush shreds leaves out of it that flutter down on the\n    air, eddying and drifting downwind, with a twig or two and the rain\n    shaken off the leaves (fewer when the sprites are busy); enemy\n    tracers end where their rounds strike, and one glancing off stone or\n    metal (now and then off mud) skips on, slower, often up into the sky;\n    tracers and sparks never\n    thinner than a pixel and a half, so fire from a hundred metres off is\n    still an unbroken line), `flames.js` (the\n    fires as flame: five billboards over the breadth of each near fire,\n    rising two to three metres out of the wreck, each a turbulent body","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"eb61702f-a586-411f-825a-7a9c1cdb2474","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:14:29.614Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"    water throws up a spout of spray and spreads a ring flat on it; a round\n    into a hedge or a bush shreds leaves out of it that flutter down on the\n    air, eddying and drifting downwind, with a twig or two and the rain\n    shaken off the leaves (fewer when the sprites are busy); enemy\n    tracers end where their rounds strike, and one glancing off stone or\n    metal (now and then off mud) skips on, slower, often up into the sky;\n    tracers and sparks never\n    thinner than a pixel and a half, so fire from a hundred metres off is\n    still an unbroken line), `flames.js` (the\n    fires as flame: five billboards over the breadth of each near fire,\n    rising two to three metres out of the wreck, each a turbulent body","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"733eff60-86e6-441a-a9