{"parentUuid":"6316f9d5-d62b-4fa6-a635-6d4560d6779b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGweCMr7RhjGSF3NVMnr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01W3vwKm5PL3XvNfjAqiQmqZ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"N=\"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md\"; cat >> \"$N\" <<'EOF'\n\nTurn of 2026-10-22, sixteenth:\n- Dropped (not done): canopy shade for the undergrowth on low quality - vegetation shares materials\n  with houses and tree crowns (matlib.resolve), so it would need a height term (crowns above the\n  canopy stay lit); little gain on high (the default preset in config.js is 'high').\n- 2ca68857 tracers burn: effects.tracer() = core streak (size 0.04, #ffe8c8 x3.2 -> caller colour,\n  streak 0.012 -> 0.016) + glow streak (0.2 m, #ff5a1e a0.5) + head (spark cell 0.07, minPx 3,\n  spawned speed*0.016/2 ahead, life shortened to match). On screen the head shows at the LEFT end of\n  a tracer moving +x when looking north (+x is screen-left facing +z) - that is correct.\n  tracers.js / tracers_own.js (stepped clock): crossing at 25/60 m, incoming from 45 m, the player's\n  own from the muzzle (glow already metres out in frame 1: no glare). Clip mv_tracers.mp4 sent.\n  Checks: low/medium/high compile (97/147/147, 0 bad), 9 node checks, merge-tree with main clean.\n  Not seen in a real browser window.\nEOF\nREDACTED; cd $S && node hl.mjs stop; rm -rf hl-profile; pkill -f \"nocache_server.py 8766\"; sleep 1; lsof -nP -iTCP:8766 -sTCP:LISTEN | head -2; lsof -nP -iTCP:9337 -sTCP:LISTEN | head -2; pgrep -fl \"hl-profile|nocache_server\" | head; cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git status --short | head; git log --oneline -1","description":"Note this turn, stop the rig and verify it is down","timeout":60000,"dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,