7/147, 0 bad), 9 node checks, merge-tree with main clean.\n  Not seen in a real browser window.\nEOF\nREDACTED; cd $S && node hl.mjs stop; rm -rf hl-profile; pkill -f \"nocache_server.py 8766\"; sleep 1; lsof -nP -iTCP:8766 -sTCP:LISTEN | head -2; lsof -nP -iTCP:9337 -sTCP:LISTEN | head -2; pgrep -fl \"hl-profile|nocache_server\" | head; cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git status --short | head; git log --oneline -1","description":"Note this turn, stop the rig and verify it is down","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true,"timeout":60000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
