{"parentUuid":"8ec6b142-592f-4e80-ab8a-283374c5d022","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGwgbM1v1N9X9o3UHrjt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Committed 2ca68857 on `hedgerow-grass` (not pushed): tracers now burn as glowing lines instead of thin pale scratches. I checked them headless only, on still frames and in `mv_tracers.mp4` (sent above, a machine gun firing bursts from 40 m at exactly 60 fps), never in a real browser window.\n\n- **The problem:** a tracer was one thin, pale-yellow streak. Crossing the dark lane it read as a scratch on the picture, and incoming it was a faint dash.\n- **What changed:** each tracer is now three particles flying together:\n  - a white-hot core line, drawn a little longer by its speed;\n  - a soft orange-red glow around it;\n  - a bright head at the front, which never shrinks below 3 pixels, so a distant tracer is still a point of fire on its line.\n- **Comparison:** I compared old and new at 60 fps, crossing at 25 m and 60 m and incoming from 45 m. Your own tracers leave the muzzle fast enough that their glow is already several metres out in the first frame, so there's no glare at your eye.\n- **Dropped:** I considered extending last round's canopy shading to the ferns and bushes on low quality. The vegetation shares its materials with the houses and tree crowns, so it would need extra height handling, for little gain on the default high preset. I left it out.\n- **Checks:** all three quality presets compile with no errors, the nine node tests pass, and the branch still merges cleanly with `main` (it's rebased on it). `origin/hedgerow-grass` still has the pre-rebase history.\n\nThe test server and headless Chrome are stopped, and the shared notes have this round's details."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":229,"cache_read_input_tokens":748412,"output_tokens":555,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":229,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":555,"cache_read_input_tokens":748412,"cache_creation_input_tokens":229,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":229},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"0b9fbf7e-308f-4345-9328-5be6f5332ce6","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGwgaaNMwNbbYALznY6T","requestRef":"8cf40999-6381-4171-b626-8fcb78a272a5","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"fe7d3dcf-9af8-4008-8102-0452928d78ac","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:15:58.124Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-grass","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
