{"parentUuid":"4dd65507-a25c-41fa-9b94-cb10151eaef7","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"271b7250-8fae-4799-957d-05a5211730a7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01K7xP1dnhB8gnDyS1WtFJN3","type":"tool_result","content":"2:   the wind, a last orange glow low in the west, and lightning that lights\n3:   the clouds from inside (and, about half the time, a forked bolt down to\n8:   to a pool of light on the cloud, and two flak guns sending streams of\n9:   tracer up into it in bursts (front()). */\n24:uniform float uTime, uFlash;\n25:uniform vec3 uFlashDir;\n48:// a stroke of lightning down to the horizon under the flash (about half the strikes; the rest\n52:float boltLine(float x, float w) { return exp(-x * x / (w * w)); }\n54:float boltPath(float el, float seed) {\n58:vec3 bolt(vec3 d) {\n59:  float seed = fract(sin(dot(uFlashDir.xz, vec2(12.9898, 78.233))) * 43758.5453);\n61:  float az0 = atan(uFlashDir.x, uFlashDir.z);\n64:  float top = clamp(asin(uFlashDir.y), 0.2, 0.95);         // from the flash in the cloud\n69:  float x = boltPath(el, seed);\n70:  float slope = (boltPath(el + 0.0008, seed) - boltPath(el - 0.0008, seed)) / 0.0016;\n72:  float k = boltLine(a, 0.0016) * 26.0 + boltLine(a, 0.006) * 2.2 + exp(-a / 0.035) * 0.35;\n82:    float xb = boltPath(e0, seed) + sl * (e0 - el) + (noise(vec2(el * 300.0, seed * 51.0 + fi * 17.0)) - 0.5) * 0.004;\n84:    k += (boltLine(ab, 0.0013) * 12.0 + boltLine(ab, 0.005) * 1.0) * (1.0 - t) * (1.0 - t);\n115:  // flak: two guns sending streams of tracer up into the cloud, in bursts\n180:  // lightning: a bright patch inside the clouds plus a general lift\n181:  float fd = max(dot(d, uFlashDir), 0.0);\n182:  col += vec3(0.75, 0.8, 1.0) * uFlash * (0.25 + 1.6 * pow(fd, 6.0) * (0.4 + cloud));\n195:  // the bolt, through the rain and the haze low down\n196:  if (uFlash > 0.05) col += bolt(d) * sqrt(min(uFlash, 1.0)) * (0.45 + 0.55 * smoothstep(-0.01, 0.08, el));\n208:    uFlash: { value: 0 },\n209:    uFlashDir: { value: new THREE.Vector3(0, 0.4, 1).normalize() },\n242:      uniforms.uFlash.value = flash;\n243:      if (flashDir) uniforms.uFlashDir.value.copy(flashDir);\n/* Hedgerow — the dusk sky: a dome with layered rain clouds drifting with\n   the wind, a last orange glow low in the west, and lightning that lights\n   the clouds from inside (and, about half the time, a forked bolt down to\n   the horizon under it); burning farms light the cloud base over them,\n   and the far barrage's flashes catch it. The colour at the horizon is the fog colour, so\n   the land fades into the sky. Far beyond the trees, the front: three\n   searchlights sweeping the cloud base, each a pale beam from the horizon\n   to a pool of light on the cloud, and two flak guns sending streams of\n   tracer up into it in bursts (front()). */\n\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\n\nconst VERT = /* glsl */ `\nvarying vec3 vDir;\nvoid main() {\n  vDir = normalize(position);\n  vec4 p = projectionMatrix * modelViewMatrix * vec4(position, 1.0);\n  gl_Position = p.xyww;\n}`;\n\nconst FRAG = /* glsl */ `\nuniform vec3 uZenith, uHorizon, uGlow, uFog;\nuniform vec3 uGlowDir;\nuniform float uTime, uFlash;\nuniform vec3 uFlashDir;\nuniform vec2 uWind;\nuniform float uArty;\nuniform vec3 uArtyDir;\nuniform float uFlare;\nuniform vec3 uFlareDir;","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"b1f95507-45cf-4821-b53c-e6b5bd031868","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:16:44.680Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"2:   the wind, a last orange glow low in the west, and lightning that lights\n3:   the clouds from inside (and, about half the time, a forked bolt down to\n8:   to a pool of light on the cloud, and two flak guns sending streams of\n9:   tracer up into it in bursts (front()). */\n24:uniform float uTime, uFlash;\n25:uniform vec3 uFlashDir;\n48:// a stroke of lightning down to the horizon under the flash (about half the strikes; the rest\n52:float boltLine(float x, float w) { return exp(-x * x / (w * w)); }\n54:float boltPath(fl