{"parentUuid":"7d46a027-e89e-4421-a7d4-0ab5d441c204","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGyGnakLq9mQ3eiSNoUN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AGJwZZ8KUgtnd1PmFWNMZ4","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"N=\"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md\"; cat >> \"$N\" <<'EOF'\n\nTurn of 2026-10-22, seventeenth (user: \"record gameplay demo video, fullhd, ~1 minute\"):\n- Dropped the lightning idea: sky.js already draws a forked bolt on about half the strikes and\n  flak tracer streams.\n- Demo video: scratchpad/hedgerow-demo-1080p60.mp4 (60 s, 1920x1080, 60 fps, H.264 2-pass 12 Mbps,\n  90 MB, silent - headless capture has no audio). Sent to the user. Nothing committed for it.\n  How (scratchpad, reusable): HL_SIZE=1920,1080 node hl.mjs start \".../fun/hedgerow/?god&go&at=1.5,6\"\n  (no ?debug: no stats overlay); auto.js takes over requestAnimationFrame + performance.now (each\n  window.__auto.frame() = one game frame of exactly 1/60 s, so adaptResolution stays at 100% and\n  motion is smooth however slow the render) and drives the player: KeyboardEvents (KeyW,\n  ShiftLeft sprint, KeyD unstick, KeyR, Digit2, KeyG cook/throw), input.test.aim/click/hold for\n  the mouse, G.rig.yaw/pitch for the view (yaw 0 = +z, pi/2 = +x; +pitch up); route = LANE then\n  STREET polylines; targets = nearest enemy with a SIGHT raycast to chest/head/waist within 58 m,\n  pressing on aimed past 22 m, give up after 7 s (ignored 8 s), a grenade at the MG at 14-34 m.\n  rec.mjs: per frame Runtime.evaluate(frame) + Page.captureScreenshot jpeg 92 (includes the DOM\n  HUD) -> ~80 ms/frame, 3600 frames in 5.4 min, ~2 GB of JPEGs (deleted after encoding; the disk\n  has ~20-30 GB free). CRF 20 gave 515 MB (the grain) - use 2-pass 12M.\n  Run: sprint up the lane, firefights at 30-57 m, grenade on the checkpoint MG nest under a flare\n  (~20 s), the checkpoint, the burning street, Thompson at 57 s; 7 enemies down.\nEOF\nREDACTED; cd $S && node hl.mjs stop; rm -rf hl-profile; pkill -f \"nocache_server.py 8766\"; sleep 1; lsof -nP -iTCP:8766 -sTCP:LISTEN | head -2; lsof -nP -iTCP:9337 -sTCP:LISTEN | head -2; pgrep -fl \"hl-profile|nocache_server\" | head; git -C /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass status --short | head -3; git -C /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass log --oneline -1","description":"Note the demo recording, stop the rig and verify it is down","timeout":60000,"dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1189,"cache_read_input_tokens":813474,"output_tokens":1950,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":192},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1189,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1950,"cache_read_input_tokens":813474,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1189,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1189},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01AGJwZZ8KUgtnd1PmFWNMZ4":{"command":"N=\"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md\"; cat >> \"$N\" <<'EOF'\n\nTurn of 2026-10-22, seventeenth (user: \"record gameplay demo video, fullhd, ~1 minute\"):\n- Dropped the lightning idea: sky.js already draws a forked bolt on about half the strikes and\n  flak tracer streams.\n- Demo video: scratchpad/hedgerow-demo-1080p60.mp4 (60 s, 1920x1080, 60 fps, H.264 2-pass 12 Mbps,\n  90 MB, silent - headless capture has no audio). Sent to the user. Nothing committed for it.\n  How (scratchpad, reusable): HL_SIZE=1920,1080 node hl.mjs start \".../fun/hedgerow/?god&go&at=1.5,6\"\n  (no ?debug: no stats overlay); auto.js takes over requestAnimationFrame + performance.now (each\n  window.__auto.frame() = one game frame of exactly 1/60 s, so adaptResolution stays at 100% and\n  motion is smooth however slow the render) and drives the player: KeyboardEvents (KeyW,\n  ShiftLeft sprint, KeyD unstick, KeyR, Digit2, KeyG cook/throw), input.test.aim/click/hold for\n  the mouse, G.rig.yaw/pitch for the view (yaw 0 = +z, pi/2 = +x; +pitch up); route = LANE then\n  STREET polylines; targets = nearest enemy with a SIGHT raycast to chest/head/waist within 58 m,\n  pressing on aimed past 22 m, give up after 7 s (ignored 8 s), a grenade at the MG at 14-34 m.\n  rec.mjs: per frame Runtime.evaluate(frame) + Page.captureScreenshot jpeg 92 (includes the DOM\n  HUD) -> ~80 ms/frame, 3600 frames in 5.4 min, ~2 GB of JPEGs (deleted after encoding; the disk\n  has ~20-30 GB free). CRF 20 gave 515 MB (the grain) - use 2-pass 12M.\n  Run: sprint up the lane, firefights at 30-57 m, grenade on the checkpoint MG nest under a flare\n  (~20 s), the checkpoint, the burning street, Thompson at 57 s; 7 enemies down.\nEOF\nREDACTED; cd $S && node hl.mjs stop; rm -rf hl-profile; pkill -f \"nocache_server.py 8766\"; sleep 1; lsof -nP -iTCP:8766 -sTCP:LISTEN | head -2; lsof -nP -iTCP:9337 -sTCP:LISTEN | head -2; pgrep -fl \"hl-profile|nocache_server\" | head; git -C /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass status --short | head -3; git -C /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass log --oneline -1","description":"Note the demo recording, stop the rig and verify it is down","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true,"timeout":60000}},"serverClassifierRequest":"1555c586-5d8f-4878-b6f7-c7fcdb666a56","apiBlockIndex":4,"requestId":"req_011CgGyGmn8P7ojGqT9i4zxV","requestRef":"90c83897-4a92-4f4f-bdd1-d8a79ed739d9","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"42938980-040f-4d01-ba05-e48a9b0