{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","hash":"1e25da0b2ea8b7b24cc01e38fa1c9274b1411f2fbd29d6d819622c6373b5a6bd","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The run took down 7 enemies: the checkpoint MG gunner, four riflemen around the checkpoint, and a rifleman and SMG gunner up the street. The frames are deleted (32 GB free again). Sending the video:"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017T1yGWWNLvZDmSbK52fqvF","name":"SendUserFile","input":{"files":["REDACTED.mp4"],"caption":"Hedgerow gameplay demo: 60 s, 1920×1080 at 60 fps, H.264 12 Mbps, 90 MB, silent. Sprint up the sunken lane, a grenade on the checkpoint MG nest under a flare, the fight through the checkpoint, into the burning street.","status":"normal","display":"attach"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01A7HTtbN5nZdudaVmMT8u2z","name":"mcp__ccd_turn__update_plan","input":{"advance":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AGJwZZ8KUgtnd1PmFWNMZ4","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"N=\"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md\"; cat >> \"$N\" <<'EOF'\n\nTurn of 2026-10-22, seventeenth (user: \"record gameplay demo video, fullhd, ~1 minute\"):\n- Dropped the lightning idea: sky.js already draws a forked bolt on about half the strikes and\n  flak tracer streams.\n- Demo video: scratchpad/hedgerow-demo-1080p60.mp4 (60 s, 1920x1080, 60 fps, H.264 2-pass 12 Mbps,\n  90 MB, silent - headless capture has no audio). Sent to the user. Nothing committed for it.\n  How (scratchpad, reusable): HL_SIZE=1920,1080 node hl.mjs start \".../fun/hedgerow/?god&go&at=1.5,6\"\n  (no ?debug: no stats overlay); auto.js takes over requestAnimationFrame + performance.now (each\n  window.__auto.frame() = one game frame of exactly 1/60 s, so adaptResolution stays at 100% and\n  motion is smooth however slow the render) and drives the player: KeyboardEvents (KeyW,\n  ShiftLeft sprint, KeyD unstick, KeyR, Digit2, KeyG cook/throw), input.test.aim/click/hold for\n  the mouse, G.rig.yaw/pitch for the view (yaw 0 = +z, pi/2 = +x; +pitch up); route = LANE then\n  STREET polylines; targets = nearest enemy with a SIGHT raycast to chest/head/waist within 58 m,\n  pressing on aimed past 22 m, give up after 7 s (ignored 8 s), a grenade at the MG at 14-34 m.\n  rec.mjs: per frame Runtime.evaluate(frame) + Page.captureScreenshot jpeg 92 (includes the DOM\n  HUD) -> ~80 ms/frame, 3600 frames in 5.4 min, ~2 GB of JPEGs (deleted after encoding; the disk\n  has ~20-30 GB free). CRF 20 gave 515 MB (the grain) - use 2-pass 12M.\n  Run: sprint up the lane, firefights at 30-57 m, grenade on the checkpoint MG nest under a flare\n  (~20 s), the checkpoint, the burning street, Thompson at 57 s; 7 enemies down.\nEOF\nREDACTED; cd $S && node hl.mjs stop; rm -rf hl-profile; pkill -f \"nocache_server.py 8766\"; sleep 1; lsof -nP -iTCP:8766 -sTCP:LISTEN | head -2; lsof -nP -iTCP:9337 -sTCP:LISTEN | head -2; pgrep -fl \"hl-profile|nocache_server\" | head; git -C /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass status --short | head -3; git -C /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass log --oneline -1","description":"Note the demo recording, stop the rig and verify it is down","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true,"timeout":60000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
