{"parentUuid":"748d772c-1b4a-43f6-8b78-cbc53f60e0a8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGyJcBEbybqc7ofF65Sb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I recorded and sent the gameplay demo (attached above): 60 s at 1920×1080, 60 fps, H.264 at 12 Mbps, 90 MB. It has **no sound**, because headless Chrome captures no audio.\n\n- **What's in it:** a sprint up the dark sunken lane toward the burning village, with searchlights overhead. Then firefights with riflemen at 30–57 m, aimed down the sights with the Garand. A flare goes up over the checkpoint and a grenade lands on the MG nest. Then the fight through the checkpoint under the street lamps, and into the burning street, switching to the Thompson. 7 enemies go down.\n- **How it was made:**\n  - It's the real game at full quality with the normal HUD (objective, compass, ammo, hints) and no debug overlay.\n  - A script plays it: it walks the lane and street, aims at enemies it can see, fires, reloads and throws the grenade.\n  - God mode was on, so the player can't die.\n  - I stepped the game exactly 1/60 s per captured frame. The motion is smooth even though rendering ran at about 12 fps while capturing, so the video says nothing about real-time frame rate.\n- **Encoding:** at near-lossless quality the game's film grain and rain made the file 515 MB. The final two-pass encode at 12 Mbps (YouTube's recommended rate for 1080p60) only softens the grain slightly.\n\nThe file is `REDACTED.mp4`. I deleted the 2 GB of captured frames, stopped the test server and browser, and committed nothing for the video. The lightning idea I'd started is dropped: the sky already draws forked bolts."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":250,"cache_read_input_tokens":817161,"output_tokens":627,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":250,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":627,"cache_read_input_tokens":817161,"cache_creation_input_tokens":250,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":250},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"32470daf-ca98-4d7b-be54-4c8bc3ba2da3","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGyJbVZUSWonbefiwqqg","requestRef":"feb7b7df-ad0e-4377-a0cb-d61af56e1df1","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"4e782989-f321-46b1-9729-21b3cbef2499","timestamp":"2026-10-22T08:37:15.655Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"REDACTED","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-grass","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
