{"parentUuid":"f4298827-cad1-4612-83a6-d41bb2e0835b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGzCjHa36rfveHBtWRUC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JcaHs866vgCwjCnjG7hMeR","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"N=\"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md\"; cat >> \"$N\" <<'EOF'\n\nTurn of 2026-10-22, eighteenth:\n- Reviewed the demo video: under the flare (20-40 s) display mean 18 -> 63-73, saturation 0.31 ->\n  0.16-0.19: white wet roofs and road, snowy verge, flat grey sky. Root: fixed exposure (1.7).\n- 4ca06131 adapt.js (eye adaptation, gap item 7 done): pass before the grade in setEffects; every\n  6th frame a 32x18 UnsignedByte target of log2 luminance (16 samples/patch, -16..8 packed in R+G)\n  read with renderer.readRenderTargetPixelsAsync (no stall); MEDIAN patch (mean could not tell a\n  fire from a flare; bottom 28% rows weight 0.5); exposure = base x clamp(2^(k(ref - m)), min, 1),\n  ref -5, k 0.75, min 0.35, tau 0.45 s closing / 2.5 s opening, holds 0.5 s after lightning and drops\n  meterings taken in one. fx.adapt exposes params, metered, factor (settable for checks).\n  Calibration (median log2): lane -6.1, lit street -5.3, forest -6.8, burning truck -4.2; flare entry\n  -4.5, street -3.7. Lightning trace: factor 1.000 throughout. Clip mv_adapt.mp4 sent.\n  Checks: low/medium/high compile (98/148/148, 0 bad) and meter, 9 node checks, merge with main clean.\n  Not seen in a real browser window. The demo video predates this (fixed exposure).\nEOF\nREDACTED; cd $S && rm -rf rec_flare snaps/demo; node hl.mjs stop; rm -rf hl-profile; pkill -f \"nocache_server.py 8766\"; sleep 1; lsof -nP -iTCP:8766 -sTCP:LISTEN | head -2; lsof -nP -iTCP:9337 -sTCP:LISTEN | head -2; pgrep -fl \"hl-profile|nocache_server\" | head; git -C /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass status --short | head -3; git -C /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/h